abstract: >-
  AetherSovereignty is the fifteenth candidate of the Aether family. It investigates
  whether sovereignty — the structural responsibility that organizes authority,
  normative reference, and veto relations within an autonomous agent system —
  constitutes an independent architectural dimension, or whether it is merely an
  emergent descriptive label for the interaction of existing dimensions.
  Current status: Phase 0 (Conceptual Genesis and Methodological Reconstruction).
  Decision: (E) Undetermined (interim). Independent review by Muhammad Talha (2026-11-23).
date-released: 2026-11-23
